# TOEIC Part 5 — Day39

## Q1

The employee _____ manages the project has more than ten years of experience.

(A) who
(B) whose
(C) where
(D) which

**정답: A**

> employee = 사람
> → who

---

## Q2

The software _____ we installed yesterday is not functioning properly.

(A) who
(B) which
(C) whose
(D) where

**정답: B**

> software = 사물
> → which

---

## Q3

Applicants _____ qualifications meet the requirements will be contacted.

(A) who
(B) which
(C) whose
(D) where

**정답: C**

> qualifications = applicants의 자격 요건
> → 소유 관계이므로 whose

---

## Q4

The conference room _____ the meeting was held is on the second floor.

(A) who
(B) which
(C) whose
(D) where

**정답: D**

> conference room = 장소
> → where

---

## Q5

The manager _____ I spoke with yesterday will contact you later.

(A) who
(B) where
(C) whose
(D) which

**정답: A**

> manager = 사람
> → who

**포인트:**
who 뒤에 `I spoke with`가 나오므로 who는 목적어 역할을 한다.

